      182.61,
      469.09,
      418.99,
      480.16
    ],
    "text": "EXCISE DUTY ON LOCALLY PRODUCTED WINE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      494.65,
      546.37,
      518.8
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amended from time to time,I, Mangala Samaraweera, Minister of Finance do by this Order direct that with effect from March 06, 2019 :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.69,
      533.65,
      546.41,
      583.72
    ],
    "text": "(1) There shall be levied on liquors produced from local plant materials or plant products or potable local animalmilk, containing not more than 18% by volume of alcohol manufactured by process other than distillation in SriLanka, shall be levied a duty at the rate of Rupees Six Hundred (Rs. 600.00) per litre of alcohol, that such dutyshall not be levied or recovered on any quantity of the aforesaid liquor, which is exported out of the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.69,
      598.69,
      546.32,
      622.72
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Excise Notification, No. 946 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1733/4 of 21 November 2011 ishereby rescinded.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
